==English==

===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ǵerh₂-}}
From the late 19th c., from {{der|en|la|grānum||grain, seed or small kernel}}. {{doublet|en|gram|grain|corn}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|grana}}

# {{lb|en|biology}} A [[stack]]-like structure in [[plant]] [[chloroplast]]s that contain [[chlorophyll]]; the site of [[photosynthesis]].

===Etymology 2===

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|obsolete|regional}} One's [[grandmother]].

